<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20413" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόσκω</span></b> , impf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔβοσκον</span>, 
			Ep.
		
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόσκε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					15.548
				</span></i>
			: fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					17.559
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				590
			</span></i>: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐβόσκησα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					18.7
				</span></i>
			: pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βεβόσκηκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMag.</u>
					6.13
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>:—
				Pass.
			 and 
				Med.
			 (v. infr. <i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>); 
				Ion.
			
			impf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοσκέσκοντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					12.355
				</span></i>
			: fut.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοσκήσομαι</span> Sarap. in <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.398d
			</span></i>, 
				Dor.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοσκησεῦμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					5.103
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐβοσκήθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					34
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Babr.
				89.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b> prop. of
			herdsmen, <i>feed, tend</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰπόλια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					14.102
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταὦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Stratt.
					27
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ βόσκων</span>
			<i>the feeder</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				540a18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>feed, nourish</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόσκει γαῖα</span>
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">. . ἀνθρώπους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					11.365
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				14.325
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαστέρα βοσκήσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					17.559
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντα βόσκουσαν φλόγα . . Ἡλίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					1425
				</span></i>
			; <i>maintain, keep</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικούρους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.39
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναυτικόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.48
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυναῖκας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					260
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκέτας</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1204
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Herod.
				7.44
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. νόσον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					313
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πράγματα β.</span> troubles, i.e.
			children, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				313
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, of cattle, <i>feed, graze</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				21.49
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύλοχον κάτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.162
				</span></i>
			: c.acc., <i>feed on</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποίην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Merc.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				232
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				118
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				591a16
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					244
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>to be fed</i> or <i>nurtured</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰυγμοῖσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					26
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κούφοις πνεύμασιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					558
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλπίσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					617
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. τινί</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τι</span>
			<i>run riot in</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.271
			</span></i> (Paul. Sil.), prob. in <i><span class="en">
				285
			</span></i> (Id.). (<i>g[uglide]ō</i>, cf. Lith.
				<i>guotas</i> 'herd'.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
